  "translation": "Mi tettwattwaɣ-d, tebɛa-d ɣer bab n urgaz-is, tenna: Nekk reẓẓeɣ ⟨seg⟩ umdan i huma ⟨i⟩ ne-s. Tenna daɣen: Eɛref, ma ulac aɣilif, anwa i d-yesɛan ⟨i⟩ taẓekkta-agi, d tiqacerḍin-agi, d yiɣsan-agi.",
